    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Field school is a comedic narrative game inspired by the absurdity of archaeological dig sites. :O</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet a cast of characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greater than or equal to <u>6</u> whole characters to meet and be socially awkward to!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do some <u>real</u> archaeology!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, fetching coffee for people.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unwravel the secrets of the past!?!?!?!!?!??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??!?!?!!?!?!?!!!?!!??:S!?!?!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen to the radio!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our archaeologist said that you aren't actually allowed to do that so much on a dig site but I really wanted to make a radio so you can do that to if you like. Apparently it can drown out people saying things like &quot;Help! I've fallen into this pit of rich rich history!&quot; or something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune in to DirtFM for more on the topic.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Field school is a comedic narrative game inspired by the absurdity of archaeological dig sites. :O</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet a cast of characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greater than or equal to <u>6</u> whole characters to meet and be socially awkward to!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do some <u>real</u> archaeology!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, fetching coffee for people.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unwravel the secrets of the past!?!?!?!!?!??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??!?!?!!?!?!?!!!?!!??:S!?!?!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen to the radio!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our archaeologist said that you aren't actually allowed to do that so much on a dig site but I really wanted to make a radio so you can do that to if you like. Apparently it can drown out people saying things like &quot;Help! I've fallen into this pit of rich rich history!&quot; or something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune in to DirtFM for more on the topic.</p>",
    "short_description": "A 3D narrative adventure featuring archaeology, humour, Italian desserts, and an original radio station.",
